(Regression guard for the Repeat <count> times, loop. Phase A made
 `times` a multiplication operator, and `times` is the same token the
 Repeat loop consumes, yet the suite had only Rust unit tests for Repeat
 — no .vox integration test at all. This locks the construct at
 integration level: a literal count, a variable count, and a `times`
 multiplication in a Print that must not be confused with the loop
 keyword. Expected: tick, tick, tick, var, var, 24.)

Repeat 3 times,
  Print "tick".

a number called k is 2.
Repeat k times,
  Print "var".

Print 2 times 3 times 4.